⚙️ PART 3: SCREEN LOAD (OnVisible)

This is the brain when the app opens.


---

STEP 1: Get section from link

Set(varSectionName, Param("section"))

👉 If link has:

&section=QA

Then:

varSectionName = "QA"


---

STEP 2: Load Sections

ClearCollect(colSections, 'SE Section List')

👉 Creates a local copy of sections
✔ Faster than querying SharePoint every time


---

STEP 3: Select current section

Set(
    varSelectedSection,
    LookUp(colSections, Title = varSectionName)
)

👉 Finds the section from the URL


---

STEP 4: Load Suppliers

ClearCollect(
    colSuppliers,
    Filter('SE Supplier List', Section.Value = varSelectedSection.Title)
)

👉 Only suppliers of selected section


---

STEP 5: Load Questions

ClearCollect(
    colQuestions,
    Filter(
        'SE Question List',
        'Section In-charge'.Value = varSelectedSection.Title
    )
)

👉 Only questions for that section


---

STEP 6: Compute Width

Set(varTotalWidth, CountRows(colQuestions) * 110)

👉 Why? Each question column = 110px
So total width grows dynamically


---

STEP 7: Check Access

Set(
    varHasAccess,
    CountRows(
        Filter(
            'SE Access List',
            Section.Value = varSelectedSection.Title &&
            User.Email = User().Email
        )
    ) > 0
)

👉 If user is in list → TRUE
👉 Else → FALSE


